(spectre-slalom)

# Synthetic TAOS trajectory translation of INBOX/spectre-snippet-v1/simple_aero/slalom.yaml
# Working set: boost, coast-to-apogee, maneuver, terminal propnav

# Spectre metadata:
# family: Slalom
# min_time_to_go_s: 60.0
# end_range_to_go_km: 200.0
# notes:
#   - start_range_to_go_km inferred as max(end_range_to_go_km + 50, total_range * 0.5)

*title Spectre-like slalom trajectory

*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84 omega=0

*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1

  *initial geodetic alt=0.0 long=14.4425 lat=35.8766 vel=10.0 gama=0.0 psi=90.0 time=0.0 wt=1000.0

  *file slalom.dat time alt vel gamgd alpha bankgd thrust
  *segment 1 boost
    *integ dtprnt=0.1 dt=0.01
    *prop thrust=(stage1-thrust) mdot=(stage1-mdot)
    *when tseg=5 goto 2
  *segment 2 coast_to_apogee
    *integ dtprnt=0.5 dt=0.05
    *aero ca=(coast-ca) cn=(coast-cn)
    *when alt<0 stop
    *when tseg=40 goto 3
  *segment 3 maneuver
    *integ dtprnt=0.1 dt=0.1
    *aero ca=0.0 cn=0.0
    *fly alpha=0.0
    *when alt<0 stop
    *when tseg=60 goto 4
  *segment 4 terminal_pronav
    *integ dtprnt=0.5 dt=0.05
    *fly propnav=2
    *when relrng[2]<20000 stop
    *when alt<0 stop

*end
